 cooperative matrices (AMD's WMMA intrinsics) and pipelines whose root
 signature reserves AMD's AGS register space stay on SPIR-V, which runs the
 matrices on MoltenVK's VK_KHR_cooperative_matrix and reads AGS's magic UAV

---
 libs/vkd3d/msc_bridge.c | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 libs/vkd3d/state.c      |  3 +++
